🛡️ Mitigation Recommendations
IP Blocking & Rate Limiting: Implement rate limiting on /admin/login.php and temporarily block IP 45.33.32.156.
Parameterized Queries: Fix the SQLi vulnerability in products.php using prepared statements to prevent SQL commands in URL parameters.
Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA): Enforce MFA for administrative account access.
